Subject: D3D: Release 2D array storage on base level layer count change

Release texture storage when changing base level on a 2D array texture
whose new base level declares a different layer count, preventing stale
slice retention and memory leaks.

Test:
    angle_end2end_tests --gtest_filter=*Texture2DArrayTestES3.BaseLevelChange*

Bug: b/553857574
Change-Id: I683f61c8f31234eeb2c0c605bb0f27e68de52ebf
